  <!-- Guard sound choices from the user (2026-10-21). The current client plays
       Parry for every perfect parry and Block for every successful guard.
       Route the reserved parry variants when enemy attacks are defined:
       127555742263594: parry against something sharp, like claws or a weapon (current Parry)
       137580087669661: another variant of that sharp parry
       137083228478857: parry against magic or projectiles
       111913931670052: parry against a BIG attack
       5763723309: guarding against something successfully (current Block)
  -->
 </Item>
</roblox>
